---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — Oceans of NYC" currentPage="about">
  <main class="about-page">
    <h1>About Oceans of NYC</h1>
    <span class="coming-soon">Full content coming soon</span>
    <p>Oceans of NYC is a community-driven project dedicated to spotting and tracking every Fisker Ocean vehicle operating in New York City.</p>
    <p>What started as a simple curiosity has grown into a collaborative effort, with contributors across all five boroughs helping document these distinctive electric vehicles on our streets.</p>
    <p>Want to contribute? <a href="/submit">Submit a sighting</a> when you spot one!</p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .about-page h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .coming-soon {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #f5f5f5;
    color: #666;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .about-page p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .about-page a {
    color: #333;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
